        <zone h='6833' id='153' leg-item-layout='vert' name='Hourly Wage' pane-specification-id='4' param='[federated.132s0h10mk0w7j16i8h4a043p783].[:Measure Names]' show-title='false' type-v2='color' w='9750' x='89417' y='11250'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='41917' hidden-by-user='true' id='287' type-v2='text' w='37917' x='60750' y='10417'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Active Riders</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>: </run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Helvetica Neue'><![CDATA[The number of riders that had at least an order completed in <= 28 days.]]></run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Working Week*</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>: Legal standard working hours allowed per country</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Average Hours Worked per Day</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>: Average number of hours the riders worked on a given day in the selected month. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>DH-Hourly Wage - </run>
            <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Average houry wage of all riders, calculated for each rider by taking the sum of total amount paid to the rider divided by the total hours worked in the selected month. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Minimum Wage*</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>: The minimum amount of remuneration that an employer is required to pay wage earners for the work performed during a given period, which cannot be reduced by collective agreement or an individual contract.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Living Wage*</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>: It is that level of remuneration that allows a person and their family to afford all necessities, pay required taxes, and save for emergencies. The presented value is for an adult working full time. It is presented in national currency. Estimated for a family composed of two adults and two children (referred to as family 2+2). Living wage is calculated under the assumption across countries of one adult working full time and the second adult working at 80% of normal weekly hours. (edited)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Special Payments</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Helvetica Neue' underline='true'>Note</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontname='Helvetica Neue'> - There are a lot of different cases, like adjustment from miscalculation from previous period, fraud cases, adjusted rate, failed orders, and many more which can cause the special payments to be negative. Users can exclude/include this payment for more accurate numbers. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>*</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue' italic='true'>Taken from official </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue' italic='true' underline='true'>Wage Indicator </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue' italic='true'>dataset</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#fefaf1' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='2083' id='288' type-v2='dashboard-object' w='8833' x='89667' y='8083'>
          <button action='' active-visual-state-index='1' button-type='text'>
            <toggle-action>tabdoc:toggle-button-click-action window-id=&quot;{F5EA6B8E-B055-4EE6-BF00-E89C69028832}&quot; zone-id=&quot;288&quot; zone-ids=[287]</toggle-action>
            <button-visual-state>
              <caption>Definitions</caption>
              <button-caption-font-style fontcolor='#f5f5f5' fontname='Tableau Bold' underline='true' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#333333' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            </button-visual-state>
            <button-visual-state>
              <caption>Definitions</caption>
              <button-caption-font-style fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' underline='true' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            </button-visual-state>
          </button>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='21417' hidden-by-user='true' id='289' type-v2='text' w='37250' x='51417' y='77833'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Helvetica Neue' italic='true'>Click on any country in the chart above to filter batch analysis for that country</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>1) The bars represent riders </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>above</run>
            <run fontname='Helvetica Neue'>/</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#bab0ac' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>below</run>
            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>hourly minimum wage by batches.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>2) The line represents the hourly wage of the riders by batches. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Batch numbers are generally defined as </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Batches 1-4</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>: Active Riders. Batch 1 is considered the best according to dynamic pay criteria. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Batch 5</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>: Inactive Riders</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>Batch 6</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue'>: New Riders</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue' italic='true' underline='true'>Note</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Helvetica Neue' italic='true'> - Number of batches and their definitions can vary based on country/entity.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#fefaf1' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='2000' id='290' type-v2='dashboard-object' w='8917' x='42250' y='77750'>
          <button action='' active-visual-state-index='1' button-type='text'>
            <toggle-action>tabdoc:toggle-button-click-action window-id=&quot;{F5EA6B8E-B055-4EE6-BF00-E89C69028832}&quot; zone-id=&quot;290&quot; zone-ids=[289]</toggle-action>
            <button-visual-state>
              <caption>Definitions</caption>
              <button-caption-font-style fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Bold' underline='true' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#333333' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            </button-visual-state>
            <button-visual-state>
              <caption>Definitions</caption>
